      "content": "the walls are so thin... i can hear them outside. the drums. it’s not long now, is it? i can’t even feel my hands anymore. just hunger and the cold. i don't think i have the strength left to fight when they finally break through. it's just going to be a mess of blood and screaming. i don't want that. i don't want any of this.",
